### TRACKPAD (touchpad laptop)
input type:touchpad {
    tap enabled
    tap_button_map lrm
    natural_scroll enabled
    scroll_method two_finger
    dwt enabled
    middle_emulation enabled
    accel_profile adaptive
    pointer_accel 0.2
}
